# earn-flow Master Rule

## Workflow

**Lovable 생성 → GitHub export → Cursor pull → 최적화·감사·수리 → `bun run check` GREEN**

- Lovable: UI, Engine, Screen, mocks (`docs/lovable/`)
- Cursor: SSOT 수리, Supabase, wallet wire, PWA, workers, charts

## Tech Stack (고정)

| Layer | Stack |
|-------|-------|
| App | TanStack Start **v1** + React **19** + TS **strict** |
| Style | Tailwind **v4** CSS-first (`src/styles.css` `@theme`) |
| Motion | Framer Motion `LazyMotion` + `domAnimation` |
| DB | Supabase phonara-gb — RLS / RPC SECURITY DEFINER / Realtime / Edge |
| Charts | lightweight-charts + Canvas2D + Web Workers |
| Deploy | Vite PWA plugin (Cursor) |
| Repo | **pnpm monorepo** target: `apps/web` + `apps/admin` |

상세: `docs/TECH_STACK.md`

## Supabase Lock

- **ONLY:** phonara-gb (`kanftnqenuzverroodev`)
- **NEVER:** phonara-world-main, phonetok

## Runtime (현재)

- Vite + Bun (`packageManager` 전환 전 과도기)
- 신규 라우트: `src/routes/` only
- `vite.config.ts` 플러그인 수동 추가 금지

## Money

- demo: walletStore localStorage
- real: Supabase RPC only — client 발행 금지
- `useGameWallet` 경유

## Quality Gate

```bash
bun run check
```

